OL,3,CCouncil was wrong to suspend recycling
OL,4,Cduring strike, Birmingham bin boss says
OL,6,FThe council was wrong to suspend
OL,7,Fkerbside recycling when the city's
OL,8,Flong-running bin strike began,
OL,9,FBirmingham's cabinet member
OL,10,Fresponsible for waste services has
OL,11,Ftold ITV News.
OL,13,FIndependent councillor Harris Khaliq,
OL,14,Fwho took office in May, was pressed
OL,15,Frepeatedly by ITV News Central about
OL,16,Fthe decision, which saw recycling
OL,17,Fcollections suspended across
OL,18,FBirmingham for 18 months.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785782911
OL,3,CCouncil was wrong to suspend recycling
OL,4,Cduring strike, Birmingham bin boss says
OL,6,FAsked whether the previous Labour
OL,7,Fadministration had been wrong to scrap
OL,8,Frecycling, Councillor Khaliq replied:
OL,9,F"Yes."
OL,11,FHe had initially stopped short of
OL,12,Fcriticising the decision, saying
OL,13,Finstead: "The decision (was) made by
OL,14,Fthe previous administration.
OL,16,F"As the current administration, we are
OL,17,Fcommitted to building a service that
OL,18,Fworks for the residents of Birmingham.
OL,26,@uD@XpmuD@\pn
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785782911
OL,3,CCouncil was wrong to suspend recycling
OL,4,Cduring strike, Birmingham bin boss says
OL,6,F"That gives them the opportunity to be
OL,7,Fable to recycle - not just mixed
OL,8,Fwaste, not just bottles, not just
OL,9,Fcardboard, but food as well."
OL,11,FThe comments come as Birmingham City
OL,12,FCouncil reintroduces recycling
OL,13,Fcollections to parts of the city,
OL,14,Fstarting with North Birmingham and
OL,15,FSutton Coldfield.
OL,17,FThe pilot scheme includes introducing
OL,18,Fweekly food waste collections and is
OL,19,Fdue to be expanded to other parts of
OL,20,Fthe city later this year.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785782911
OL,3,CCouncil was wrong to suspend recycling
OL,4,Cduring strike, Birmingham bin boss says
OL,6,FAsked why recycling could now return
OL,7,Fto some areas, Councillor Khaliq
OL,8,Fdefended the pilot.
OL,10,FHe said: "We are running this as a
OL,11,Fpilot... we're bringing back recycling
OL,12,Fevery other week because residents are
OL,13,Fwanting that.
OL,15,F"As we are growing the stability to be
OL,16,Fable to understand the data, to
OL,17,Fcompare the different pilots on behalf
OL,18,Fof the city, we're building the
OL,19,Fservice that residents want," he adds.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785782911
OL,3,CCouncil was wrong to suspend recycling
OL,4,Cduring strike, Birmingham bin boss says
OL,6,FThe previous Labour administration
OL,7,Fsaid it suspended kerbside recycling
OL,8,Fto ensure there were enough non-
OL,9,Fstriking crews available to continue
OL,10,Fcollecting general waste during the
OL,11,Findustrial action.
OL,13,FThe council said the pilot will help
OL,14,Fshape Birmingham's future waste
OL,15,Fcollection service, with recycling
OL,16,Fcollections returning, weekly food
OL,17,Fwaste collections being introduced and
OL,18,Fgeneral waste eventually moving to
OL,19,Ffortnightly collections.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785782911
OL,3,CCouncil was wrong to suspend recycling
OL,4,Cduring strike, Birmingham bin boss says
OL,6,FHowever, the authority was unable to
OL,7,Fsay when kerbside recycling would
OL,8,Freturn across the rest of the city.
OL,10,FThe changes come while the bin dispute
OL,11,Fitself remains unresolved.
OL,13,FAsked whether he had instructed
OL,14,Fofficers to resume talks with Unite,
OL,15,FCouncillor Khaliq confirmed he had,
OL,16,Fbut declined to give further details.
OL,18,F"When we are in a position to share
OL,19,Fmore, we will share more," he said.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/7
