OL,3,CCouncil was wrong to suspend recycling
OL,4,Cduring strike, Birmingham bin boss says
OL,6,F18 months after all-out industrial
OL,7,Faction began, Birmingham is attempting
OL,8,Fto roll out a new waste collection
OL,9,Fsystem while the dispute that
OL,10,Fdisrupted it continues.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/7
